---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cats" description="The important stuff. Meet Luna and Mochi.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-6">The Important Stuff</h1>
    
    <div class="prose max-w-none mb-12">
      <p class="text-xl font-body text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
        You can learn everything you need to know about someone from how they interact with cats. 
        Here are mine: Luna (the philosopher) and Mochi (the chaos agent).
      </p>
      
      <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Luna approaches problems systematically—she'll spend ten minutes studying a closed door before 
        requesting assistance. Mochi operates on pure intuition and has yet to encounter a surface 
        she won't attempt to nap on, regardless of physics.
      </p>
      
      <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed">
        They're better at parallel processing than any distributed system I've built. 
        Luna handles strategic planning while Mochi handles execution. Usually this means Luna 
        identifies the optimal sunny spot while Mochi claims it first.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl bg-black/20 border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center text-6xl">
          🐱
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-primary text-lg">Luna</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted font-body">The Philosopher</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl bg-black/20 border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center text-6xl">
          😸
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-primary text-lg">Mochi</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted font-body">The Chaos Agent</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted font-body italic">
        Photos coming when I figure out how to get them both to sit still simultaneously.<br/>
        (This may require advances in quantum mechanics.)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
